      "content": "Exactly. It's frustrating to see it so disregarded. I often find myself sitting in quiet reflection, trying to recall the specific mandates I gave to the generals back then, wondering if I should attempt to translate those old oaths into something a modern strategist could actually grasp. If I were to attempt to bridge this gap—to bring that sense of ancestral duty back into the conversation of modern maritime law—where do you think I would encounter the most resistance from those who only see maps and kinetic advantages?",
